 example. Shouldn't it always render count: 0 within the list? basically act like v-once?\r\n\r\n```vue\r\n<div v-for=\"id in 3\" :key=\"id\" v-memo=\"[true]\">\r\n  count: {{ count }}\r\n</div>\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/892660304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqal","id":3576913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY5MTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3576913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal","html_url":"https://github.com/sqal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/892708234","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/4246#issuecomment-892708234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/4246","id":892708234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCCum1841NaWK","user":{"login":"posva","id":664177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/664177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva","html_url":"https://github.com/posva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/